---
/**
 * FlowBreakdown — static, side-by-side comparison of how each route turns the
 * same camera stream into a different product (live detection, zone monitor,
 * PPE monitor, structured decisions, typed extraction, and both combined). Presentational only; used on the
 * architecture page.
 */
---

<section class="flow-breakdown container" aria-labelledby="flow-breakdown-title">
	<div class="section-heading">
		<p class="eyebrow">Route by route</p>
		<h2 id="flow-breakdown-title">The same camera stream, six different products</h2>
	</div>

	<div class="flow-grid">
		<article class="flow-card corner-card live-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/</span>
				<h3>Live detection</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills" aria-label="Live detection flow">
				<span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>/api/detect</span><b>→</b><span>DETR</span><b>→</b><span>overlay</span>
			</div>
			<p>One DETR inference per sampled frame. Bounding boxes render directly over the live feed.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="flow-card corner-card zone-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/zone</span>
				<h3>Zone monitor</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills" aria-label="Zone monitor flow">
				<span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>DETR</span><b>→</b><span>geometry</span><b>→</b><span>event log</span>
			</div>
			<p>Person boxes are intersected with a normalized zone. Entry and exit events stay in memory.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="flow-card corner-card ppe-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/ppe</span>
				<h3>PPE monitor</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills stacked" aria-label="PPE monitor flow">
				<div><span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>/api/detect</span><b>→</b><span>DETR</span></div>
				<div><span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>/api/ppe</span><b>→</b><span>vision LLM / Clef Flash</span></div>
			</div>
			<p>Fast boxes stay responsive while a selectable vision model (Llama Vision, LLaVA, Gemma 4, or <code>@cf/cloudflare/clef-flash</code>) checks headwear every few seconds.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="flow-card corner-card decide-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/decide</span>
				<h3>Decision dashboard</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills" aria-label="Decision dashboard flow">
				<span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>/api/decide</span><b>→</b><span>Clef Flash</span><b>→</b><span>probabilities</span>
			</div>
			<p><code>@cf/cloudflare/clef-flash</code> evaluates 1–64 typed <code>noul</code>, <code>choice</code>, and <code>score</code> questions in a single forward pass with calibrated probabilities and zero output tokens.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="flow-card corner-card extract-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/extract</span>
				<h3>Extraction dashboard</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills" aria-label="Extraction dashboard flow">
				<span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>/api/extract</span><b>→</b><span>Clairic</span><b>→</b><span>typed values</span>
			</div>
			<p><code>@cf/cloudflare/clairic</code> reads 1–32 typed fields—counts, readings, dates, text, lists—with a confidence or p10–p90 interval on every value.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="flow-card corner-card xd-card scroll-reveal">
			<span class="corner-top-right"></span>
			<span class="corner-bottom-left"></span>
			<div class="flow-top">
				<span class="route-badge">/extract-decide</span>
				<h3>Extract + Decide</h3>
			</div>
			<div class="flow-pills" aria-label="Extract + Decide flow">
				<span>camera</span><b>→</b><span>Clef Flash</span><b>→</b><span>gate / route</span><b>→</b><span>Clairic</span><b>→</b><span>one answer</span>
			</div>
			<p>Clef Flash decides what is in frame and whether to measure; Clairic reads the values; the Worker does the maths (hydration, caffeine, standard drinks, finger products, watch geometry).</p>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.flow-breakdown {
		padding-block: 26px 44px;
	}

	.section-heading {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin-inline: auto;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 8px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		color: var(--cf-orange);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.flow-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 16px;
		margin-top: 28px;
	}

	.flow-card {
		padding: 22px;
		background: var(--cf-bg-200);
		border: 1px solid var(--cf-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
		transition:
			box-shadow var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out),
			transform var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out),
			border-color var(--duration-normal) var(--ease-out);
	}

	.flow-card:hover {
		border-style: dashed;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.live-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-orange);
	}

	.zone-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-compute);
	}

	.ppe-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-storage);
	}

	.decide-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-media);
	}

	.extract-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-sase);
	}

	.xd-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--cf-orange);
	}

	.flow-top {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.route-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		min-height: 32px;
		padding: 6px 11px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		color: var(--cf-bg-100);
		background: var(--cf-orange);
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
	}

	.zone-card .route-badge {
		background: var(--cf-compute);
	}

	.ppe-card .route-badge {
		background: var(--cf-storage);
	}

	.decide-card .route-badge {
		background: var(--cf-media);
	}

	.extract-card .route-badge {
		background: var(--cf-sase);
	}

	h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 21px;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.flow-pills,
	.flow-pills div {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
	}

	.flow-pills.stacked {
		align-items: stretch;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.flow-pills span {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 32px;
		padding: 6px 10px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		color: var(--cf-text);
		background: var(--cf-bg-100);
		border: 1px solid var(--cf-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-full);
	}

	.flow-pills b {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--cf-text-muted);
	}

	p {
		margin: 18px 0 0;
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--cf-text-muted);
	}

	p code {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--cf-text);
	}

	@media (min-width: 720px) {
		.flow-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}
	}

	@media (min-width: 1120px) {
		.flow-grid {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
